{
  "answer": "If the Payments Database goes down, the following services will be affected:\n\n**Direct Dependencies:**\n1. **Payment Service** - This service requires the Payments Database for all transaction storage.\n2. **Fraud Detection Service** - This service queries historical transactions from the Payments Database.\n\n**Cascading Dependencies:**\n1. **Checkout Service** - This service processes payments through the Payment Service, which depends on the Payments Database.\n2. **API Gateway** - This service routes payment requests to the Payment Service, which depends on the Payments Database.\n\nThus, the complete list of affected services includes:\n- **Directly Affected:** Payment Service, Fraud Detection Service\n- **Cascading Affected:** Checkout Service, API Gateway\n\nIn total, the affected services are: Payment Service, Fraud Detection Service, Checkout Service, and API Gateway.",
